1 NOTE <p style="margin: 0.5em 0px; color: #202122; font-family: sans-serif;">Hijo del empresario Gast&oacute;n Pascal Lyon y la exdiputada socialista&nbsp;<a style="text-decoration-line: none; color: #0b008
